      "content": "thanks for the breakdown. wait, just to make sure i follow—is the annual amount $5,000 or $4,400? i'm a little confused by the two different numbers you gave. also, is there any other way people usually describe this process of the value dropping every year, like is there a specific term for that \"wearing out\" feeling of the asset losing its worth?",
